            "verseId": "ISA.65.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.10.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bar 10:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA akagamba ati: Nkeeteekaniza kuserurwa abo abataransabire; nkeeteekaniza kuzoorwa abo abataranserwire. Nagamba ihanga eritaranyesengeriize nti: Dara nyowe, ndi hanu, ndi hanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.10.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bar 10:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasiibaga ntegiire emikono abantu abeemi, abanyakukora ebintu ebitali birungi, abanyakukuraatira amagezi gaabo gonka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu abanyakwikara nibambiihiza, mbataireho eriiso abanyakutambira ebyonzira omu misiri, kandi nibacumiikirirra obubbaani ha matafaali; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abanyakwikara omu bituuro kandi abanyakuraara omu biikaro ebya ha rubaju abanyakulya enyama y'empunu, kandi kunu baina omucwe ogw'ebintu ebirukuzirwa omu bibindi byabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abanyakugamba bati: Otatwirra haihi, habwokuba, tuhinguraine kwera, tosobora kutukwataho, abantu nk'abo, rwoya rw'omunyindo zange, murro ogunyakusiiba nigwaka ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkacwamu ira kubafubira, n'ekifubiro kyabo kikahandiikwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tindiganyira ebibaakozire, baitu ndibasasura habw'ebibi byabo, na habw'ebibi bya baisenkurubo, MUKAMA nukwo arukugamba ati; habwokuba bakacumikirirra obubbaani hansozi, kandi mwanjumira ha busozi, habweki, ndibafubira nindorra ha bikorwa byabo ebyaira ebi baakozire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA naagamba ati: nk'eviini okwesangwa omu mugimba, abantu bakagamba bati: otagusiisa, habwokuba harumu omugisa, na nyowe nukwo ndikora nti habw'abaheereza bange, boona tindibahwerekereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobbo ndimwihamu abaijukuru, kandi Yuda; ndimwihamu abagwetwa ab'ensozi zange abakomerwemu bange nubo baligigweterwa, kandi abairu bange nubo baligiikaramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.7.24+JOS.7.25+JOS.7.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 7:24-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habw'abantu bange abaanserwire, Sarooni eriba iriisizo ly'amagana, kandi ekihanga ky'Akora, kiriba kiikaro ky'ente kubyamamu kiriba ky'abantu bange abanserwire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu inywe abaarugireho MUKAMA, abaayeberwe orusozi rwange orurukwera, abaateekaniriize Gaadi emeeza, inywe abanyakwituruura eviini ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inywe nimbata ha kitara, inywena muliitwa habwokuba nkabeeta, timwagarukamu, nkagamba timwahurra. Ekiinyeta kibi, nikyo mwakozire, ekimbiihiza, nikyo mwagondeze kukora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikyo MUKAMA Ruhanga arukugambira ati: Abairu bange balirya baitu inywe mulirumwa enjara, abairu bange balinywa, baitu inywe muliitwa iroho; abairu bange balisemererwa, baitu inywe mulihemurwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abairu bange balizina baina omutima ogw'omuhimbo, baitu muliteera omuranga habw'omutima ogw'obusaalizi, kandi muliborooga habw'obujune bw'omwoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibara lyanyu, mulisigira abakomerwemu bange, libe nk'omukyeno, kandi inywe, Ruhanga alibaita; baitu abairu be alibaruka ibara erindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 65:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki, omuntu anyakwesabira omugisa omunsi, Ruhanga ow'amazima aligumuha, n'ogu anyakurahirra omunsi, Ruhanga ow'amazima alimurahirra; habwokuba emihito eyaira eyebere, endugire hamutima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.65.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.65.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
